# @name authenticate_user
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "murilo2",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

# @name Create_question 
Post {{baseUrl}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
